    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Marcel Embraced his distant cousin Christopher, a street-hardened runaway, hoping to groom a family heir capable of helping rule New Orleans. Christopher instead spent his first year of unlife running wild through the Quarter, defying his sire at every turn. Marcel's creation of a second, more tractable childe, Anthony, only spurred Christopher into deeper rebellion, though he has since moderated his behavior enough to keep his comfortable place in Marcel's household. He does not realize that Dutch quietly protects him as a possible future @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah}-friendly claimant to the throne, nor that a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.OpCOs3PLjmtl0QVu]{Ventrue} antitribu has taken an interest in him.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Speak little and reveal less; when you do speak, be curt and vaguely threatening.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Celerity 1, Dominate 1, Fortitude 2, Potence 1, Presence 3.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Marcel Guilbeau. Will not feed on anyone over 20 years old. Haven: several in the French Quarter, plus a room in Marcel's house. Secrets rating: B.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
